Wrong (A): $300,000 is the income adjustment, not the tax liability. The imputed underpayment applies the 37% rate to the adjustment.
Wrong (C): Individual partner liability of $100,000 each would apply only if the partnership elected push-out treatment under Section 6226, which it did not.
