  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under Securities Act Section 4(a)(2) and SEC Regulation D, Rule 506(c) permits general solicitation (including social media advertising) but requires that all purchasers be accredited investors whose accredited status must be verified through reasonable steps. No non-accredited investors may participate.
Wrong (A): Rule 506(b) allows up to 35 sophisticated non-accredited investors but prohibits general solicitation. General solicitation and non-accredited investors are mutually exclusive under Regulation D.
